error[MR0115]: an extension adds no indexers
  --> tests/ui/syntax/constant_recovery.mr:19:5
   |
19 |     this[i: int]: int { get => (const x: int) => x; } //~ ERROR MR0115 //~ ERROR MR0110 //~ ERROR MR0110 //~ ERROR MR0110 //~ ERROR ...
   |     ^^^^ an indexer
   |
   = note: an indexer is declared in the type itself; an extension may add a method that takes the index, as `At(i: int): int`
